%% Order to cash, one credit sale end to end.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor B as Pembeli / Sales
  actor M as Marketing
  participant OSM as OrderStateMachine
  participant DB as Ledger (stok, kredit)
  actor G as Gudang
  actor F as Finance
  participant PL as PaymentLedger

  B->>OSM: Ajukan order (draft → submitted)
  M->>OSM: Setujui
  activate OSM
  OSM->>OSM: OrderSplitter.plan: satu gudang atau pecah?
  OSM->>DB: resolvePrice, snapshot harga, DPP, PPN per baris
  OSM->>DB: CreditChecker: limit, umur piutang > 150 hari = beku
  OSM->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE, reservasi stok
  OSM-->>M: confirmed (semua potongan, atau tidak sama sekali)
  deactivate OSM
  M->>OSM: Tagihkan (→ awaiting_payment)
  OSM->>DB: Terbitkan faktur, jatuh tempo 30 hari
  G->>OSM: Cetak surat jalan, Tandai dikirim (→ shipped)
  OSM->>DB: stock_movements: reservasi jadi pengurangan, HPP diposting
  F->>PL: Catat pembayaran (transfer / tunai / giro cair)
  PL->>DB: payment_entries, payment_allocations (append-only)
  PL->>OSM: Faktur tertutup penuh → shipped → completed (aktor null)
